**State as I read it:** the relay task is past acceptance and the canary was its only rollout, so it still owes docs (stage 14), backlog final (15) and cleanup (16). RDP audio is a new task and starts at stage 0. Operator-facing text below is in English, this session's language. `R=~/work/ccs.ansible`, `S` = my scratch dir, `INBOX=$S/inbox`.

